{"slug":"/students/subjects/biology/transport/excretory-systems/","source":"students/subjects/biology/transport/excretory-systems.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Excretory Systems | Biology","description":"","subject":"biology","body":"<div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\n        <nav class=\"mb-8\">\n            <a href=\"/students/subjects/biology/transport/\" class=\"text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700\">← Back to Transport Systems</a>\n        </nav>\n        \n        <div class=\"content-card rounded-xl p-8\">\n            <header class=\"mb-8\">\n                <h1 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Excretory Systems</h1>\n                <p class=\"text-lg text-gray-600\">Understanding waste removal and homeostatic regulation</p>\n            </header>\n\n            <div class=\"space-y-8\">\n                <!-- Learning Objectives -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Learning Objectives</h2>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-gray-700\">\n                        <li>• Understand the structure and function of excretory organs</li>\n                        <li>• Explain the process of urine formation</li>\n                        <li>• Analyze homeostatic mechanisms in excretion</li>\n                        <li>• Compare excretory systems across different organisms</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Video Content -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Video Lessons</h2>\n                    <div class=\"aspect-w-16 aspect-h-9 mb-4\">\n                        <iframe title=\"Excretory Systems Overview\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VIDEO_ID\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\" class=\"w-full h-[400px] rounded-lg\"></iframe>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-4\">\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Video 1: Kidney Structure</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Anatomy and function of the nephron</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Video 2: Urine Formation</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Filtration, reabsorption, and secretion</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Key Concepts -->\n                <section class=\"space-y-6\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800\">Key Concepts</h2>\n                    \n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">1. Kidney Structure and Function</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-gray-700\">\n                            <li>• Nephron structure:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Bowman's capsule</li>\n                                    <li>- Proximal tubule</li>\n                                    <li>- Loop of Henle</li>\n                                    <li>- Distal tubule</li>\n                                    <li>- Collecting duct</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>• Blood supply</li>\n                            <li>• Filtration membrane</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">2. Urine Formation Process</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-gray-700\">\n                            <li>• Ultrafiltration:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Blood pressure</li>\n                                    <li>- Selective filtration</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>• Selective reabsorption:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Active transport</li>\n                                    <li>- Passive transport</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>• Tubular secretion</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">3. Homeostatic Regulation</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-gray-700\">\n                            <li>• Water balance:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- ADH mechanism</li>\n                                    <li>- Osmoregulation</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>• pH regulation:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Acid-base balance</li>\n                                    <li>- Buffer systems</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">4. Comparative Excretion</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-gray-700\">\n                            <li>• Mammals</li>\n                            <li>• Fish</li>\n                            <li>• Insects</li>\n                            <li>• Environmental adaptations</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Practical Activities -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Practical Activities</h2>\n                    <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Kidney Dissection</h3>\n                            <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                <li>• External features</li>\n                                <li>• Internal structure</li>\n                                <li>• Blood vessel identification</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Urine Analysis</h3>\n                            <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                <li>• pH testing</li>\n                                <li>• Glucose detection</li>\n                                <li>• Protein testing</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Assessment Questions -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Self-Assessment</h2>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">1. Describe the process of ultrafiltration in the kidney.</p>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Include structure and pressure relationships.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">2. Explain how ADH controls water reabsorption.</p>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Include cellular mechanisms and physiological effects.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">3. Compare excretion in terrestrial and aquatic animals.</p>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Consider environmental challenges and adaptations.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-50 to-teal-100 p-6","bodyStyle":"","css":["body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }\n        .content-card {\n            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n        }"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}